{"overview":"در یک قلعه باستانی عمیق در دل تپه‌های اسکاتلند، مجری برنده جوایز، آلن کامینگ، شرکت‌کنندگان را به انجام مأموریت‌های هیجان‌انگیز هدایت می‌کند تا صندوق جایزه‌ای تا ۲۵۰,۰۰۰ دلار بسازند؛ در میان «وفاداران» تراژدی‌ها پنهان‌اند که هدفشان حذف وفاداران و تصاحب جایزه برای خود است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Hosted by award-winning actor Alan Cumming at an ancient castle set deep in the Scottish Highlands, contestants work together on a series of exhilarating missions to build a prize fund worth up to $250,000. Hidden amongst the Faithful are the Traitors, whose goal is to eliminate the Faithful and claim the prize for themselves.","tagline_en":"Ordinary people. Extraordinary deceit.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":11,"y":2023,"poster":"/8h4I6wzhZoUPpRtFPEz3MaJiabG.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2024,"poster":"/nGE7GJy2Uxu9l612LpuVjcy50ka.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":12,"y":2025,"poster":"/9Yhs5qPYa1cbWsmD3ysrPpltRBU.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/xWK9tLH2UGgzuAI6P3cHeTKopfj.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/1iEhpzcHwuvPcqtt9tkUAX1hxqx.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":1,"y":null,"poster":""}],"episodes":60,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US","GB"],"cast":[{"name":"الن کومینگ","role":"Self - Host","photo":"/axil8ufunARfqyU4ceZNh36fkVQ.jpg","en":"Alan Cumming"}],"trailer":"P3rqVPKOKfQ","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/215943-the-traitors/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"fuboTV","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/3wF8xISfVlcrc8X3jaa3uMUFGAr.png"},{"n":"Peacock Premium","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/a1UIdq5BrkcAxnxcUhFsNbXnxeu.png"},{"n":"Peacock Premium Plus","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/yrEwyMzEKdqAoGhaWUARtIxByol.png"},{"n":"NBC","kind":"ads","logo":"/geRNAmvuPF6hOLExMHLKpt7bGBD.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/215943-the-traitors/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Sky Go","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/1Yvl9eP3pmktqChitnFhHJHcBtX.png"},{"n